        "original_id": "208ed187-6ff2-5000-8b33-d0ce4934a3f2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Festival Foods, SuperValu, Wells Fargo & Company\n- Products: Essential Everyday\n- People: Michael W. Wright\n- Roles: chief executive officer, director\n\nFacts:\n- SuperValu, Inc. is an American retailing company.\n- Michael W. Wright served as chief executive officer of SuperValu from 1981 to 2001.\n- Festival Foods' private label brands are supplied by SuperValu, and most of those brands use the Essential Everyday label.\n- Michael W. Wright is currently a director of Wells Fargo & Company.",
